"Skiff is a popular A-rank water Shaper, a hero-in-residence on the Chicago hero team."
"He hosts beach volleyball and kids' charity events and had a spotless casualty record."
"Chasing an earth-shaping villain, he flooded downtown buildings and collapsed a sewer."
"The villain he drowned ended up in intensive care, and Skiff looked strained on TV."
"In February he waited across from the Chicago consulate in board shorts and a puffer jacket."
"He played Sweet Smasher on his phone while watching the consulate."
"Boe calls him the Aquatic Idiot."
"He had been spying on Alden Thorn, possibly for the Velras."
"His name is Lawrence, and he is thirty-one."
"He is a CNH High and university alumnus; the school rejected his merman persona."
"He sat on Alden's CNH alumni evaluation panel."
"He fought a man who tried to build a lair under Lake Michigan."
"By the Matadero crisis he is Chicago's most popular hero, with a house near Montrose Beach."
"He answers fan mail personally and was emergency-summoned to F-city's Nilama in the flood."
